        "value": 1,
        "visible": true,
        "selected": false,
        "description": "<p>Ortiz&#39;s Saint Michael medal, in her left hand, under the flashlight. As long as she holds it up and doesn&#39;t attack, any creature that wants to come within two meters has to beat her in a contested Willpower test (Resolve + Composure against hers). She doesn&#39;t know why it works. It works.</p>"
